{
  "version": "shadowplay.story.v1",
  "title": "The Moth Who Borrowed Light",
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "prologue",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "Prologue",
      "text": "The Moth Who Borrowed Light"
    },
    {
      "id": "lamp-on",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "hush",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Shh, {child|little one}. The show is about to begin."
    },
    {
      "id": "mo-arrives",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "arriving",
      "restU": 0.18,
      "restV": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "mo-intro",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "This is Mo. The Long Night took her glow, and now she cannot find her way in the dark."
    },
    {
      "id": "follow",
      "type": "follow",
      "seconds": 3,
      "text": "Raise a hand into the lamplight. Mo will follow your fingertip."
    },
    {
      "id": "trust",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "There. She trusts you now, {child|little one}."
    },
    {
      "id": "lighthouse",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Far away, the lighthouse by the sea still shines. Mo must borrow a little of its light."
    },
    {
      "id": "ch1",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "Chapter One",
      "text": "Chapter One: The Field"
    },
    {
      "id": "mo-rests",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.08,
      "restV": 0.44
    },
    {
      "id": "field",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "field"
    },
    {
      "id": "field-wide",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "But the field is wide, and the grass is taller than the sky."
    },
    {
      "id": "who",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Mo is far too small to cross it alone. Who could carry her?"
    },
    {
      "id": "want-rabbit",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "rabbit",
      "alt": "ears",
      "text": "Make a rabbit with your hand, and hold it in the light."
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A rabbit! Quick, and kind."
    },
    {
      "id": "mo-rides",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.32,
      "text": "Move your hand to carry Mo across the field."
    },
    {
      "id": "mo-lands",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.42,
      "restV": 0.05
    },
    {
      "id": "thanks",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Across the field at last. Thank you, rabbit."
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The rabbit bows. It will remember you."
    },
    {
      "id": "journal-rabbit",
      "type": "journal",
      "creature": "rabbit",
      "text": "Rabbit added to your Shadow Journal."
    },
    {
      "id": "end-ch1",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "End of Chapter One."
    },
    {
      "id": "go-on-1",
      "type": "continue",
      "text": "Raise an open hand into the light to go on, or pinch the lamp switch to rest."
    },
    {
      "id": "ch2",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "Chapter Two",
      "text": "Chapter Two: The River"
    },
    {
      "id": "river",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "river"
    },
    {
      "id": "mo-bank",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.4,
      "restV": 0.05
    },
    {
      "id": "river-dark",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A dark river runs under the moon. Mo cannot swim, and the far bank is a long way off."
    },
    {
      "id": "river-carry",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Something in the water could carry her, if it were big enough."
